            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The Supreme Court granted certiorari to decide whether Section\u202f1806(f) displaces the state\u2011secrets privilege in civil lawsuits alleging illegal government surveillance."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Respondents",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "57ea5d9bc577453e7df11fc4173900104e1d10f11d50c1ebfc1be0bd4bc6fc5b",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-57ea5d9bc577-0000-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 9,
              "start": 9
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Respondents, the respondents allege that the FBI illegally surveilled them because of their religion."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Petitioners",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "63561d050342e748e538db8d31c0e0b9b76301c129c158016443d84a4cf26426",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-63561d050342-0000-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 4,
              "start": 4
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Petitioners argue that the state\u2011secrets privilege is grounded in the Constitution and common law and is essential for national security."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Government",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "57ea5d9bc577453e7df11fc4173900104e1d10f11d50c1ebfc1be0bd4bc6fc5b",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-57ea5d9bc577-0001-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 11,
              "start": 11
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The Government contends that \u00a71806(f) is relevant only when a litigant challenges the admissibility of the government\u2019s surveillance evidence."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "57ea5d9bc577453e7df11fc4173900104e1d10f11d50c1ebfc1be0bd4bc6fc5b",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-57ea5d9bc577-0000-0005"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 6,
              "start": 6
            }
          },
          {
            "document_hash": "57ea5d9bc577453e7df11fc4173900104e1d10f11d50c1ebfc1be0bd4bc6fc5b",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-57ea5d9bc577-0001-0005"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 13,
              "start": 13
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The Court held that \u00a71806(f) has no effect that would displace the state\u2011secrets privilege and therefore reversed the Ninth Circuit."
      }
    ],
